# Bug 3 & Bug 4:
#   - Bug 3: Calling a 1-arg text command with NO argument ("find-user") does not
#     report "error: missing email"; strsep on "" silently passes email=""!
#   - Bug 4: Failed mutating commands ("add-user bob,not_an_int" or duplicate key)
#     still return 1 from @dispatch and get appended to the persistence journal file!

Users is a collection.
Each user has an email (text) and an age (number).
Emails are unique.
Reject duplicates.

add-user: add a user.
find-user: find a user by email.
remove-user: remove a user by email.
